  <title>Introduction</title>

  <introduction>
    <p> Welcome to our project! In this work, you will find all of the assignments and resources for our program. 
      This is intended to be your jumping off point for all aspects of the project and thus will include links to other content as well as directly hosted content. 
      We would like to thank the Michigan State University Provost's office "AI-Ready Spartans" grants challenge for their generous funding of this pilot project. 
      We would also like to thank the Zekelman Holocaust Center, Ferris State University and Institution TBD for their collaboration. </p>
